  "abstract": "This is the eighth experiment in my systematic ablation of the SOTA, and the first to investigate the factorized loadings. I have previously confirmed the optimality of the input-adaptive gate and MLP hyperparameters. This experiment tests the `proj_rank` of the spatial projection. I hypothesize that a smaller, more parsimonious projection rank might offer a better performance trade-off. I am reducing this parameter from 36 to 32, with all other aspects of the SOTA architecture held constant for a controlled comparison.",
